  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions as whip of spiders, except it summons centipedes, and any creature you strike with the whip takes swarm damage as if it were attacked by a centipede swarm (2d6 points of damage plus poison and distraction, Bestiary 43). If you transform the whip into a centipede swarm, it has 10 hit points.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell functions as whip of spiders, except it summons centipedes, and any creature you strike with the whip takes swarm damage as if it were attacked by a centipede swarm (2d6 points of damage plus poison and distraction, bestiary 43). if you transform the whip into a centipede swarm, it has 10 hit points.\"",
